1 0 0 1 50 740 Tm /F1 10 Tf ([PARA | SEC=Section III \(Clause 3.1 - 2016 Historical Rule\)] Historical Compulsory Enrolment Rule \(2016-2020\): Under the 2016 Operational Guidelines \(effective from Kharif 2016, 2016-04-01 until superseded by the Revamped Guidelines on 2020-03-31\), PMFBY enrolment was 100% compulsory \(mandatory\) for all loanee farmers availing Seasonal Agricultural Operations \(SAO\) credit / Kisan Credit Card \(KCC\) loans for notified crops, and voluntary only for non-loanee farmers.) Tj
