1 0 0 1 50 710 Tm /F2 10 Tf ([TABLE_HEADERS | ID=TBL_OG2016_HIST_RULES] Provision | Season / Scope | 2016 Historical Value | Unit / Basis | Historical Qualification \(Effective 2016-04-01 to 2020-03-31\)) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 696 Tm /F1 9 Tf ([TABLE_ROW | ID=TBL_OG2016_HIST_RULES | ROW=TBL_OG2016_HIST_RULES_R1] Maximum Farmer Premium \(Kharif Food Grains & Oilseeds\) | Kharif ? All food grain and oilseed crops | 2.0% of Sum Insured | % of Sum Insured | 2.0% of Sum Insured or Actuarial rate, whichever is less \(unchanged in 2016 and 2023\)) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 683 Tm /F1 9 Tf ([TABLE_ROW | ID=TBL_OG2016_HIST_RULES | ROW=TBL_OG2016_HIST_RULES_R2] Maximum Farmer Premium \(Rabi Food Grains & Oilseeds\) | Rabi ? All food grain and oilseed crops | 1.5% of Sum Insured | % of Sum Insured | 1.5% of Sum Insured or Actuarial rate, whichever is less \(unchanged in 2016 and 2023\)) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 670 Tm /F1 9 Tf ([TABLE_ROW | ID=TBL_OG2016_HIST_RULES | ROW=TBL_OG2016_HIST_RULES_R3] Maximum Farmer Premium \(Annual Commercial & Horticultural\) | Kharif and Rabi ? Annual commercial and annual horticultural crops | 5.0% of Sum Insured | % of Sum Insured | 5.0% of Sum Insured or Actuarial rate, whichever is less \(unchanged in 2016 and 2023\)) Tj
